    {
      "id": "p0021-b003",
      "kind": "caption",
      "source": {
        "text": "This Japanese battle cry was translated literally into English as \"I will turn you into a beehive\", resulting in a bizarre, hilarious, non- threatening threat. In English, we'd probably say something like ''I'll fill you full of holes!\" or \"I'll turn you into Swiss cheese!\" instead (Game: Star Ocean: The Second Story)",
        "raw": "This Japanese battle\ncry was translated\nliterally into English as\n\"I will turn you into a\nbeehive\", resulting in a\nbizarre, hilarious, non-\nthreatening threat. In\nEnglish, we'd probably\nsay something like ''I'll\nfill you full of holes!\"\nor \"I'll turn you into\nSwiss cheese!\" instead\n(Game: Star Ocean: The\nSecond Story)",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
          0.736265,
          0.53158571,
          0.88753384,
          0.74360714
        ],
        "mask_bbox": [
